Negative control for the descriptor being the ONE archetype verdict.

Re-derives the archetype in the renderer instead of reading the descriptor the
harness produced, so the surface dispatched on can disagree with the reflected
verdict — two classifiers, one job.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: module-renderer.spec.ts — the descriptor's archetype is what dispatches.

